# Belladonna Took's ability counts its own resolutions this turn (CR 608.2m). Lingering Souls makes two Spirit tokens
# at once: the first trigger gains 1 life, the second draws a card. Its flashback makes two more: the third resolution
# puts a +1/+1 counter on each creature Bella controls (Belladonna and all four Spirits, since the tokens are there
# already) and the fourth does nothing at all (no life, no card, no counters) - the boundaries 1, 2, 3 and 4.
# Mana is activated just before each cast so each payment is exact: Ruby + Pearl for Belladonna, Black Lotus for
# Souls, Jet + Emerald for the flashback.

